All eight SHA-256 values match the assignment; path/hash bindings are in result.json.

Scope: visible typography, stems/options/labels, superscripts, signs,
parentheses, stacked fractions, legibility, overlap and actual right terminals.
ASCII `^` and `/` below transcribe visible superscripts and stacked fractions,
not source text or a mathematical interpretation.
